TUF-27 SplitTryte TUI & Braille Graphics Bank v1.0

Specialized character vocabulary for Text User Interfaces (TUI), including high-density Braille graphics, box-drawing characters, and block/shading elements.

[LAYOUT]
splitTryte = [11|OPTIONS|BANK_L|VAL_L2|VAL_L1|VAL_L0|BANK_R|VAL_R2|VAL_R1|VAL_R0]
standard_marker = 11

[DESIGN_RULES]

1. Every splitTryte stores two self-contained TUI elements.
2. BANK:+ is Braille Core Patterns (for graphing and plotting).
3. BANK:- is Box Drawing Characters (for frames, borders, and dividers).
4. BANK:0 is Block, Shade, Quadrant & Arrow UI Controls.
5. Full pair table is generated by crossing every left element against every right element.

[BANK_LANES]

+ = UPPER_ALPHA          = 10
- = LOWER_ALPHA          = 00
0 = NETIV_NUMERIC_SYMBOL = 01

